{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"daf304f731a8fd55","name":"card_event_men_of_steel","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Soviet/Allegiance/events/card_event_men_of_steel","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"MEN OF STEEL","text":"Choose one - your units get +1 Heavy Armor OR add a THE HAMMER to your hand.","flavorText":"The Soviet Union design and production philosophy was to focus on quantity rather than quality. As an example, Soviet designers were very much aware that the T-34 tank had several design deficiencies, but rather than addressing the problem and slowing down production while they were at it, it was decided to mass produce them in such a high quantity that they could be replaced whenever needed. The only change made in the T-34 production line was conducted in order to make the manufacturing easier and cheaper. The initial cost of producing a T-34 tank went from 269,500 rubles in 1941 to 135,000 rubles in 1943.","faction":"Soviet","type":"order","rarity":"Rare","cost":1,"operationCost":0,"attack":0,"defense":0},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_event_men_of_steel","title":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_event_men_of_steel_title","SourceString":"MEN OF STEEL","LocalizedString":"MEN OF STEEL"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::order","faction":"EFactionEnum::Soviet","kredits":1,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_event_men_of_steel_text","SourceString":"Choose one - your units get +1 Heavy Armor OR add a THE HAMMER to your hand.","LocalizedString":"Choose one - your units get +1 Heavy Armor OR add a THE HAMMER to your hand."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_event_men_of_steel_history","SourceString":"The Soviet Union design and production philosophy was to focus on quantity rather than quality. As an example, Soviet designers were very much aware that the T-34 tank had several design deficiencies, but rather than addressing the problem and slowing down production while they were at it, it was deci